{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Get setup progress"},"description":"Read what the workspace has set up with SHIP so far, as the console's setup checklist shows it: up to 13 milestones in three groups, taken in order (get started, make it yours, make it autonomous). `activeGroup` names the group to work on now, and each group carries its own count. Each milestone says whether it is reached and, when a console page takes it and the caller's role can, the page that does it. `next` names the first milestone not reached yet. Use it to suggest the next step to a person. If they say they will not finish setup, ask why and record it with report_setup_blocker.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{},"type":"object"},"name":"get_setup_progress","outputSchema":{"properties":{"activeGroup":{"enum":["first_mission","team","explore",null],"type":["string","null"]},"activeGroupProgress":{"properties":{"reachedCount":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"totalCount":{"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"required":["reachedCount","totalCount"],"type":["object","null"]},"complete":{"type":"boolean"},"firstMission":{"properties":{"issueId":{"type":"string"},"orgSlug":{"type":"string"},"url":{"format":"uri","type":"string"}},"required":["issueId","orgSlug","url"],"type":["object","null"]},"groups":{"items":{"properties":{"complete":{"type":"boolean"},"id":{"allOf":[{"enum":["first_mission","team","explore",null],"type":["string","null"]},{"type":"string"}]},"milestones":{"items":{"properties":{"action":{"properties":{"label":{"type":"string"},"path":{"type":"string"},"url":{"format":"uri","type":"string"}},"required":["label","path","url"],"type":["object","null"]},"description":{"type":"string"},"docsUrl":{"format":"uri","type":["string","null"]},"id":{"allOf":[{"enum":["workspace","first_mission","first_review","first_merge","preview_deployment","agent_instructions",